[32.205, "o", "\u001b[1;35m=== Lapis: Crystal Export Templates Architecture ===\u001b[0m\r\n  Godot Export Templates provide the pre-compiled native runner binary for each OS.\r\n  Lapis bundles Crystal libraries as shared GDExtension libraries that load at boot:\r\n    \u2022 Windows : godot.windows.template_release.x86_64.exe + game.dll\r\n    \u2022 Linux   : godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64    + libgame.so\r\n    \u2022 macOS   : Godot.app (Universal Binary)              + libgame.dylib\r\n  \u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m Current version: Godot 4.8.dev6 templates installed in AppData/Roaming\r\n\r\n"]
